<title>LITHUANIA: SANITAS SAYS 1.34 MLN LITAS NET PROFIT IN JULY.</title>
<headline>SANITAS SAYS 1.34 MLN LITAS NET PROFIT IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first seven months of 1997</p>
<p>					 ( amounts in million litas)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     5.34 vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Sales			   27.7  vs 23.38</p>
<p>Notes: Sanitas' figures for the first seven months</p>
<p>of the year are compared to the figures of the first half of</p>
<p>1997. The company is the largest pharmaceutical producer in</p>
<p>Lithuania.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
